error[keywords]: `component` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:3:10
   │
 2 │ interface ComponentTest {
 3 │     void component();       // 'component' is a keyword
   ·          ^^^^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 4 │     void connector();       // 'connector' is a keyword
 5 │     void port();            // 'port' is a keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_component`
 note: keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers

